WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.953
"The king is really hungry," Cook said.

2
00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:17.183
She quickly cooked more food.

3
00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:35.951
Tom sprinkled more powder on it.

4
00:00:35.952 --> 00:00:39.619
The king and his guests ate the food.

5
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:47.275
"More!" they cried. "More food!"

6
00:00:47.276 --> 00:00:50.958
"I am almost out of food," Cook said.

7
00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:56.138
"I am almost out of powder," Tom said.

8
00:00:56.139 --> 00:00:59.658
Dirk said, "Bring more food!

9
00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:07.914
Or you will go to the Grim Dungeon!"

10
00:01:07.915 --> 00:01:16.244
Cook and Tom looked in every cupboard.

11
00:01:16.245 --> 00:01:21.144
They found stale bread and moldy cheese.

12
00:01:21.145 --> 00:01:30.058
Tom sprinkled powder on it.

13
00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:35.180
The guests ate it.

14
00:01:35.181 --> 00:01:39.274
"The guests must be full now," Cook said.

15
00:01:39.275 --> 00:01:44.108
"I hope they don't get sick," Tom said.

16
00:01:44.109 --> 00:01:46.921
Dirk ran into the kitchen.

17
00:01:46.922 --> 00:01:54.108
"The king wants more food now!" he said.

18
00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:59.177
Cook started to cry.

19
00:01:59.178 --> 00:02:01.638
She clutched her apron.

20
00:02:01.639 --> 00:02:06.758
"The food is all gone!" she said.

21
00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:09.372
"I will help," Tom said.

22
00:02:09.373 --> 00:02:12.559
Tom waved his wand wildly.

23
00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.897
"Food!" he cried.

24
00:02:14.898 --> 00:02:20.408
Poof! A dead mouse appeared on the table.

25
00:02:20.409 --> 00:02:27.132
"Ick!" Cook said. "That's not food!"

26
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:29.648
Cat saw the mouse.

27
00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.944
"That's my food," she said.

28
00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:35.889
"I was hunting in the pantry."

29
00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:38.546
"Sorry, Cat," Tom said.

30
00:02:38.547 --> 00:02:42.425
"My magic powder made the food taste too good.

31
00:02:42.426 --> 00:02:45.128
Everyone wants to keep eating!"

32
00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:50.139
"Hmm . . ." Cat licked her paws.

33
00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:58.580
"I might be able to help," she said.

